    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a14013de29766da9bc82d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Feb 2026 07:10:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎回来！我是妳/你们的Dotti✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>春假后开工的第一周，大家过得如何呢？🧧</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽说这是一期年度工作总结大会，但因为之前的节目已经着重聊了我们改名字以及在纽约ADC和金点设计奖的经历，所以本期就权当是一期闲聊吧～（请允许我们水一期哈哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家开工大吉、合作愉快！💰💰💰</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 我们的2025，过得怎么样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 什么？！2025一个新客户都没有，我们还吵了一大架？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a> 年度项目遗珠和设计新尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> 「做品牌」vs「做设计」，真的不是一回事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2714">45:14</a> 关于「招聘和应聘」这回事，请注意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3174">52:54</a> 友好拒绝、合理分配 - 通往快乐职场的秘笈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3766">1:02:46</a> 关于「合伙」，请谨慎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4075">1:07:55</a> Dotti的2026展（画）望（饼）</span></p><span></span><p><span>✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>此次提及的作品有：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvOMti20FPO91hZ7YDEXmVmqXjod.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>蟠龙月满之夜（2024）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv2Gv5puNY7SNGiLRufwSwJ0shHW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>蟠龙月满之夜（2024）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlgUAI0oNViBNWqvnk8qm7bZf4P-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>新焺游园·月满蟠龙（2025）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls0xnc-V5g_4QnQ7GMo7MjTtPdDU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>新焺游园·月满蟠龙（2025）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpOiBCTt9ag_zzjBeoQXAYNRMjy-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>新焺游园·天地迎新（2026）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgrHH0TKC1YW1vOummg8mWgU9K1k.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>新焺游园·天地迎新（2026）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk5cix_McAWxelzNv7vboyymyYzb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>回到街区· 燃冉计划回顾展（2025）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnfa1YLD17AOCYo4jJ7dvwX14K9s.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>回到街区· 燃冉计划回顾展（2025）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FieMUiRWpcv1J8oeMhuiD7IbCw9-.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>北平机器· 友谊商店开业主题海报（2025）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlltV5IwcOmeSJgfHPd2QFT7McHC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>第五届北平机器煎饼节主视觉（2025）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft3ogrXYrugZme4a-jYEcYko0K_n.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>北平机器煎饼节吉祥物·饼饼（2025）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi37b4tzY6Yk3DrukYO0WZw_1r2x.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>北平机器欢庆礼盒·财神马戏（2026）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgERLMeSYltXSKM8QklMoL0kxET2.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>北平机器欢庆季·财神马戏（2026）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧨</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家下期见👋</span></p>]]></description>
